- That's not hope! \u266a\u266a\u266a Chani! \u266a\u266a\u266a I will love you as long as I breathe. \n\u266a\u266a\u266a - This prophecy is how they enslave us! \u266a\u266a\u266a - It's not a prophecy. It's a story. - I don't care what you believe! I believe. \n\u266a\u266a\u266a - I am Paul Muad'dib Atreides! \u266a\u266a\u266a Duke of Arrakis! \u266a\u266a\u266a \u266a\u266a\u266a He who can destroy a thing has the real control of it. \n\u266a\u266a\u266a \n"
